  "description": "Mongoose was born from BMX racing with products that push the limits of what a rider can do on the track. Our latest line of BMX race bikes, the Title series, have been designed using that same race pedigree. Designed for beginner-level riders, the Mongoose Title Expert gives you a trophy-worthy BMX-style bike at an amazingly affordable price!\nLightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum frame, integrated headset, and internal cable routing. 19.5” top tube length and frame weight of 2.8 lbs.\nDrivetrain features 160mm 3-piece tubular chromoly cranks with a 42T chainring and euro cartridge bottom bracket.\nArisun XLR8 20” x 1-3/8” race tires mounted on Xposure aluminum double wall rims with aluminum ball bearing front hub and 16T cog freewheel rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar (6.5\") and fork, 48 mm stem, sealed bearing headset, and alloy V-brake and brake levers. Suggested rider height is 5’0\" - 5’4”.",
